# Private workspaces — never sync to public repo.
#
# Their names are deliberately NOT listed here. This repo is public, so an ignore list
# that names them publishes them — the denylist becomes the disclosure it exists to
# prevent. They live in .git/info/exclude, which is machine-local and never published,
# and the commit guards resolve the same list from outside this tree entirely.
#
# Consequence, stated so it is not discovered the hard way: a fresh clone has neither
# the exclude file nor the hook symlinks. See hooks/README.md for the one-time setup.
.firecrawl/

.claude/focus-chain-counter
.claude/pre-compact-snapshots/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
